<https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/assessment/morphoeval-delphi10000-drosophila-serrata-turing-wavelength-s0-code-traceability> a pk:LLMClaimAssessment ;
    rdfs:label "Drosophila serrata Schnakenberg Turing wavelength at 2.123 µm (Holocene, 0 Ma) — Code-to-model traceability: 86/100" ;
    dct:date "2026-10-27"^^xsd:date ;
    dct:description "Each modelling step is a named function (jacobian, critical_delta, diffusivity, sigma_analytic, sigma_rk2, simulate_patch, ocellus_field). The Lean integers are recomputed in integer_witness and asserted in --self-test (fu = 937447, δ numerator 98855, positive margin)." ;
    dct:subject <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/concept/morphoeval-0.1.0-code-traceability> ;
    pk:assessedBy <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/model/grok-4.7> ;
    pk:assessmentType "morphoeval/0.1.0/code-traceability" ;
    pk:hasEvidence <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/evidence/morphoeval-delphi10000-drosophila-serrata-turing-wavelength-s0-code-traceability-1>,
        <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/evidence/morphoeval-delphi10000-drosophila-serrata-turing-wavelength-s0-code-traceability-2> ;
    pk:hasScore 8.6e-01 ;
    pk:hasVerdict "faithful" .

<https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/assessment/morphoeval-delphi10000-drosophila-serrata-turing-wavelength-s0-model-fidelity> a pk:LLMClaimAssessment ;
    rdfs:label "Drosophila serrata Schnakenberg Turing wavelength at 2.123 µm (Holocene, 0 Ma) — Model fidelity to source: 88/100" ;
    dct:date "2026-10-27"^^xsd:date ;
    dct:description "Jacobian, onset δ_c, k_c^2 = (δ f_u + g_v)/(2 δ D_u), and σ(k) are the Schnakenberg linearization of Turing 1952. RK2 on the same ODE agrees at r = 0.99998. The nonlinear FFT peak at k/k_c = 0.952 is not yet compared with k_max, so the off-onset shift is easy to misread as an implementation error." ;
    dct:subject <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/concept/morphoeval-0.1.0-model-fidelity> ;
    pk:assessedBy <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/model/grok-4.7> ;
    pk:assessmentType "morphoeval/0.1.0/model-fidelity" ;
    pk:hasEvidence <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/evidence/morphoeval-delphi10000-drosophila-serrata-turing-wavelength-s0-model-fidelity-1>,
        <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/evidence/morphoeval-delphi10000-drosophila-serrata-turing-wavelength-s0-model-fidelity-2>,
        <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/evidence/morphoeval-delphi10000-drosophila-serrata-turing-wavelength-s0-model-fidelity-3> ;
    pk:hasScore 8.8e-01 ;
    pk:hasVerdict "faithful" .

<https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/assessment/morphoeval-delphi10000-drosophila-serrata-turing-wavelength-s0-morphometric-validation> a pk:LLMClaimAssessment ;
    rdfs:label "Drosophila serrata Schnakenberg Turing wavelength at 2.123 µm (Holocene, 0 Ma) — Morphometric validation: 84/100" ;
    dct:date "2026-10-27"^^xsd:date ;
    dct:description "Dispersion Pearson r = 0.99998 against reference 1.0 (RMSE 0.00169 against 0). Orientation KS between plate and GIF is 0.071 against a 0.5 ceiling. Chronoseries gap sechellia−serrata is 11.14 nm against a null of 0. The east-coast nm span is reconstructed from the CHC-cline direction, not from a published wavelength table. k_measured/k_max is the missing comparison (R1)." ;
    dct:subject <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/concept/morphoeval-0.1.0-morphometric-validation> ;
