    dct:description "The simulation script(s) models/2026-delphi10000-drosophila-serrata-turing-wavelength-s0.py implement the cited source model as published and produce forms that match real Drosophila serrata specimens and the source authors' figures. A belief under audit, not a fact: its credibility is carried by the MorphoEval rubric assessments." ;
